"P2941551446" "Let me introduce you to my little friend!"
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2966159923" "Let's see how ya fight a real man."
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P870705224" "That's it.  You're gonna sleep with the fishes tonight!"

// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1651154468" "Hey!  I'm talkin' ta you!"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1792539326" "Are you disrespectin' me?"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3785119067" "We're the law on these streets."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P242024338" "The boss says  pay up.  You pay up.  Now I gotta make an example of ya."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P717998761" "You think you can stiff the Family and get away with it?"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4114353820" "You got some nerve, mac.  Some nerve."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3657677431" "All Sal said was if he couldn't beat ya, he'd arrange to have ya beaten.  That's where I come in."

// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2999597325" "You gotta problem with legitimate business?  Huh?"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1707559099" "You think you're big time?  You're goin' down big time!"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2298775883" "Today, my business is icing you."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1131041166" "You got no right interrupting Family business."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2809068375" "I'll make ya pay for that."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1154501981" "It's like I always say, 'if you can't dazzle them with brilliance, riddle them with bullets'!"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P353086069" "I ain't feeling violent.  I'm feelin' creative with weapons!"

// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3228013345" "I won't pay you thugs a dime!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3540498204" "You wouldn't be so brave if there was a hero around."
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1000676828" "I won't give in to extortion!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2484110289" "There is nothing organized about you!  You're just a bunch of thugs!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2545344397" "You're all hooligans!  Hooligans, I tell you!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P649378590" "You will not get away with this!"

// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4012689978" "Thank you! Those Family thugs are brutal!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P261254971" "Thanks for the help."
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3280832617" "You're a real life saver!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3433325830" "I thought they had me!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3710783164" "I tried to be brave but they were really scary!"

// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3623358942" "Let's teach these lugs a lesson."
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P826655941" "You lookin' at me?"
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3786398485" "You wanna start somethin'?  Fine by me!"
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P548647614" "Oh you got some nerve, man."
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3387645084" "You want trouble?  You got it, pal!"
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3236927761" "Let me take care of this, boss!"

// FIGHTCLUB_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1054314854" "You're nothin'!"
// FIGHTCLUB_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2731317253" "Rest in pieces!"
// FIGHTCLUB_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2516395990" "All things being equal, you lose!"
// FIGHTCLUB_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3981001983" "That all you got?"
// FIGHTCLUB_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3280854066" "You got nothin'!"

// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4223042380" "Save it for the masks, you two!"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3381943034" "Whatta'ya drunk or somethin'?  Paste him!"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4262847292" "You call that a punch?"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3076960663" "How you ever gonna get yourself made when you fight like that??"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1233102581" "You can't expect to be taken seriously when you use your face as a punchin' bag!"

// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1903147242" "Take 'em down!"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1253500378" "Give 'em the ol' pepper!"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1287064905" "Give 'em the ol' one-two!"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2676617533" "Let's do this, guys!"

// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2333828850" "We are unwilling to conceed to your demands."
// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1795227753" "You may wish to reconsider your position before we break your heads."
// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2777970222" "You need to remember who you're dealin' with. The Family doesn't negotiate."
// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2384081778" "How's about I help speed this up. I crack your skull in two and you spit out your answer."

// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2210345722" "Take 'em out quick-like!"
// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P575297751" "We can't be seen here."
// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2451046829" "Let's make this short and sweet."
// NEGOTIATION_NEGOTIATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P438673119" "No witnesses!"

// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2830917490" "Yeah! Give 'em the ol' one-two!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1617874174" "Let's do this thing!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2647423534" "Let's get to the beatdown!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1617061906" "Make us proud!"

// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3287386209" "We got bigger trouble!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3857612013" "Save it for the masks!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2116645714" "We got a problem, boys.  Let's solve it."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3019564000" "You know what to do!"

// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1464207967" "Bennie Red Hands says nobody better set foot on this ship."
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3057541130" "I don't see nobody."
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2816573075" "This cargo better make it to Paragon City in one piece."
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P55038386" "Lot o' Dyne on this ship.  Better keep a sharp lookout."
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P837382347" "Typical.  I get lookout duty and Johnnie gets to sit in on the poker game."

// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P632651433" "Whoa!  Trouble up ahead!"
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2471185685" "You want to turn around and run, hero."
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3568762868" "This ship ain't your business!"
// STRIGA_FAMILY_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P701440964" "I'm going to mess you up!"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P691753305" "Get these losers!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1385757230" "You should stay on your own turf!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P709037967" "The Family's through playing nice, Warriors!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2636900214" "You're on our property.  Now you're mine to deal with."

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2511179467" "Great.  You want a knuckle sandwich, too?"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1843012230" "Someone else is looking to get roughed up."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1074472941" "This is looking to be a day full of smackdowns."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3947673788" "Don't you have something better to do?"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4179655982" "Why you want to hassle a legitimate businessman?"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P480339034" "Make mincemeat outta them!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3994216524" "This is just not your day."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2868964642" "Take this message back to your leaders!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3218607982" "These docks are ours, see?  You know better."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2685901000" "Tresspassin' ain't respectful!"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1788363237" "Get rid of that hero!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1512165505" "We don't need any witnesses."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2937098893" "Well, if it isn't Captain Goody Two Shoes."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P290282563" "Boy, are you looking at a big orthodontia bill."

// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4097363025" "The Council ain't gonna know what hit 'em."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P750297597" "This'll teach the Council to mess with our docks."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1159023972" "Then we just sit back and collect the insurance."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2340988694" "This should take out a good block."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P552206095" "Mess with the Family, and the Family gets you back."

// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2932766844" "You just saw too much."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3362519843" "You shouldn't look into things that don't concern you."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3983980102" "That nose of yours just got you into trouble."

// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1414761206" "You gotta respect the local authority."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4285271849" "You pay the tax, or you don't get through."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3749989779" "Tommy wants a little extra this week."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1170110991" "Don't make trouble."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P322564280" "You know the rules.  Now pay up."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P591246840" "Fork it over, Warrior.  I ain't got all day."

// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2058257417" "Whoa, red alert!"
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1464943011" "Let's paste this punk!"
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1170415946" "Help us out and I'll knock down the tax."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_FAMILYBLOCKER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P386230775" "We got bigger fish to fry!"

// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_WARRIORSBLOCKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2611945562" "You dishonor yourself, sir."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_WARRIORSBLOCKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1621687640" "I'll get it to you next week."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_WARRIORSBLOCKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2657353620" "I must get this shipment through."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_WARRIORSBLOCKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P786059034" "You cannot raise the tariff every week."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_WARRIORSBLOCKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P314897673" "This isn't right."
// STRIGA_BLOCKSHIPMENT_WARRIORSBLOCKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3319100925" "I won't pay twice."

// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P392889894" "Did you see something?"
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P1082436607" "I thought I saw a cape."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P4061010712" "I have the feeling something bad's about to happen."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P3932095260" "Anything on your side?"

// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2786663649" "I knew it!"
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P91889504" "See?  I told you I saw someone!"
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3262563413" "Great.  The one time I'm right."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3621041856" "Wait 'til your commander hears about this!"

// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P919383317" "All clear."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P4288814692" "Negatory."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P346355253" "Uh-uh.  It's smooth sailing out there."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P3775762454" "Just calm down, ok?  Sheesh."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P451984496" "Partner, you need to relax."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_WEST_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P1761249320" "Nothing I can see."

// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1407009206" "Ok, ok.  You were right."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3764993527" "Whoa!  Incoming!"
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1637347754" "Shut up and fight."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1423168188" "We've got to deal with this now and talk about it later."

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P27387145" "We can get you those goods, but it's gonna cost you."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1305837381" "This equipment is mighty pricey."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P436344185" "It won't come cheap."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1510419868" "You're asking for a lot of top notch weaponry here."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3735448560" "Sure, the Family has connections.  For our close, personal friends."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P880335716" "The question is, how much are you willing to pay?"

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3781296719" "You're not invited!"
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P212629433" "Hey!  This is a private meeting!"
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3736613349" "You won't disrupt my negotiations!"
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P488943013" "You're gonna pay for crashing this party."

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P764683661" "Fine.  Just guarantee that the goods are untraceable."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1911323881" "Understood.  I think we have a deal."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4107522025" "I don't care what it costs, as long as it's top of the line."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDERBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P464980180" "I think we can come to an arrangement."

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1495084480" "You'll leave our turf alone if you know what's good for you."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2342198445" "The Family pulls the strings on this island."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1565925555" "You'd be wise to avoid angering us in the future."

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P734893428" "I'm gonna break your kneecaps!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3495543276" "You'll be sorry you stuck your nose in!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3913693345" "I'm gonna tear you apart!"

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2488858921" "You gonna remember this message?"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3144826389" "This oughta learn you!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1385761474" "The time for talking is over."

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P13881127" "Get that hero!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3813579921" "We've got to discourage interference."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3575964376" "Keep out of Family business."

// FAMILY_VS_5TH_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1712003683" "The boss don' like you on our turf!"
// FAMILY_VS_5TH_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3495771080" "You ain't welcomed here!"
// FAMILY_VS_5TH_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4105649261" "Council is bad enough wifout you Facist pigs."
// FAMILY_VS_5TH_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P138695750" "Go back where ya came from."

// FAMILY_VS_5TH_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1494340032" "More trouble?"

// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2904391477" "This is our turf now."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3978567589" "For the glory of the 5th Column."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P380427863" "Take that.  And this!"

// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3249808139" "You've messed up bad, and now you'll pay."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4110781961" "You don't belong here.  This is our town."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3006975550" "No problem."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1300794665" "This will be quick."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3395641169" "Fool!  Do not interfere with the 5th Column!"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1398878676" "You just signed your own death warrant."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P401099556" "You are next!"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P254408578" "Here it goes again."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1069002019" "Wha... Attack!"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2868308989" "It's a set up!"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1569043428" "We've been spotted.  Fire!"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3908076032" "Nice of you to join us!"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2659348169" "Welcome to painville."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1169020970" "Don't even think about it."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3868692506" "Don't mess with the 5th Column."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2248267694" "Leave no witnesses."

// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599936117" "Tell me what I need to know before I break your arm."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3187494959" "Bet you're sorry you messed with the 5th Column."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2798241101" "Now where's the Council cell?"
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P24315942" "I'm going to bust you up."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P279193119" "I'm going to break every bone in your body."
// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2600461191" "Sign the papers!"

// 5TH_VS_FAMILY_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_LOSING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2975345951" "We've got your number.  Now sit down."

